| O2 | LegacyExempt UTC conversion vs Created backfill? | Fail closed if Created null; convert Created→UTC (D4) |
| O3 | Repair exemption? | None; public PostAsync always gated (D5) |
| O4 | Attachment adds after first cycle? | Conservative: no delete/replace; add only when no active Pending/Approved on any revision (D8) |
| O5 | V2 fingerprint schema? | Deferred; preserve V1 (D9) |
| O6 | Applock timeout seconds | 15s, match branch stock |

Gate 1 must not start until O1–O3 are signed (O4–O6 may be confirmed in Gate 2 review).

